  "title": "Forschungsdatenmanagement Und Verwandte Themen Know How Fuer Ihr Forschungsprojekt",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Registration and further information",
      "text": "There are seven workshops in the series that will be held in March, April and May 2023, the first six of which build on each other.\n\nThe workshop series will be held online via Zoom except for workshop four. The workshops will take place on Wednesday mornings between 1 March and 3 May 2023.\n\nAll courses will be held in English. They are aimed at doctoral students, postdocs, academic staff and other members of ETH Zurich.\n\nRegister for individual workshops or the entire series of workshops on our website ."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Always up to date",
      "text": "Good to know: We can also organise additional sessions of the workshops for groups of five people or more upon request. You can schedule additional sessions on our website.\n\nMore than just data – Benefit from know-how\n\n#KnowHow – The ETH Library’s infrastructure and tools lead you to your goal."
    }
  ],
